<title>USA: Dewitt, Mich., school bonds yield 5.80 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Dewitt, Mich., school bonds yield 5.80 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
